  <h2 id="answer">The direct answer: rank paths by what a typical student gets</h2>

  <p>
    Search for the best career options after 12th with high salary and you get a list of ten to twenty
    degrees, each with a range such as "3 to 8 lakh at entry, 20 to 50 lakh later". We read eight of those
    pages.
  </p>

  <p>
